        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5112US4.LSUS15.TRUS4, Tribeca Lever with Rectangular Rose </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tribeca Lever with Rectangular Rose is one of those leversets that just catches your eye because it is so stylish. The textured handle is a great way to add a point of interest to any door. This L-Squared Tribeca Lever with Modern Rectangular Rosette is a passage function with a satin brass rosette, satin nickel stem, and satin brass lever.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, or privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TATR-specifications.gif?v=1704354544\" width=\"600\" height=\"158\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Tribeca Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the L-Square Knurled Door Lever with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Knurled L-Squared Leverset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSKN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262373\"><b>Emtek Knurled Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
